  "details": "1. Open the small menu.\n\n2. Navigate to the \"Audio\" tab.\n\n3. Attempt to scroll by using a swipe up gesture, while first tapping on a slider, such as the audio slider.\n\nExpected Behavior:\n\n- The menu should scroll smoothly as intended.\n\n- Tapping on the slider should not affect the audio volume during the scrolling process.\n\nActual Behavior:\n\n- The audio volume is being unintentionally adjusted.\n\n- The menu does not respond to the swipe up gesture, and scrolling does not occur as expected.",
